# Mapbox access token, used for geocoding addresses and static map previews
# on a participant's profile screen. Get one at https://account.mapbox.com/access-tokens/
#
# Note: the app currently lets users paste their own token in the Settings
# panel (Style -> Map), stored in the browser. This variable is not yet read
# by the app at build/runtime.
VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=
